Implement pipeline stages in pipeline.go.

func Generator(vals ...int) <-chan int
    // Spawn a goroutine that sends each val to a buffered channel, then closes it.
    // Return the channel.

func Filter(in <-chan int, pred func(int) bool) <-chan int
    // Spawn a goroutine that reads from in, sends to out only if pred(val) is true.
    // Close out when in is closed.

func MapInt(in <-chan int, f func(int) int) <-chan int
    // Spawn a goroutine that reads from in, applies f, sends result to out.
    // Close out when in is closed.

All 5 tests must pass.
